{"seq":5,"slug":"capitalism-socialism-comparison","title":"资本主义与社会主义比较","stage":"DONE","category":"political-economy","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 资本主义与社会主义比较 简介\n\n资本主义与社会主义是现代世界两种最重要的经济制度和社会理想，围绕它们的理论争论和实践探索贯穿了整个二十世纪，至今仍是理解当代社会最核心的思想坐标。本知识库从批判与比较的视角出发，系统分析这两种制度的理论基础、历史实践和当代演变。\n\n本知识库适合对比较政治经济学、社会主义理论和分配正义感兴趣的读者，尤其适合希望超越意识形态对立、以严谨的学术态度理解不同经济制度优劣的学习者。具备一定的政治经济学基础将有助于深入讨论，但本知识库也会对关键概念进行系统的阐述。\n\n第一章**资本主义批判**梳理对资本主义制度最深刻和最持久的批判传统，从异化理论到商品化分析，从剥削理论到生态危机批判，揭示资本主义制度的内在矛盾和社会代价。\n\n第二章**社会主义理论与实践**系统考察社会主义从思想到实践的历史进程，分析苏联模式、中国特色社会主义和二十一世纪社会主义等不同路径的特征和经验教训。\n\n第三章**混合经济模式**聚焦介于纯粹资本主义和纯粹社会主义之间的混合经济实践，分析北欧模式、社会市场经济、发展型国家和合作经济等多种制度安排。\n\n第四章**不平等与再分配**将讨论聚焦到当代最紧迫的社会问题之一，分析收入不平等和财富集中的趋势、成因和后果，考察各种再分配政策的效果和局限。\n\n推荐学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。先通过第一章理解对资本主义的核心批判，再在第二章中考察社会主义的替代方案及其历史实践，然后在第三章中探索混合经济的中间道路，最后在第四章中回到当代最迫切的不平等问题。这一路径从批判到替代、从理想到现实，帮助读者形成全面而审慎的判断。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capitalism-critique","title":"资本主义批判","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/capitalism-critique","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"alienation","title":"异化理论","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/capitalism-critique/alienation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commodification","title":"商品化","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/capitalism-critique/commodification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exploitation-theory","title":"剥削理论","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/capitalism-critique/exploitation-theory"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ecological-crisis","title":"生态危机","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/capitalism-critique/ecological-crisis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"socialism-theory","title":"社会主义理论与实践","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/socialism-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"socialism-history","title":"社会主义思想史","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/socialism-theory/socialism-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"soviet-model","title":"苏联模式","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/socialism-theory/soviet-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chinese-socialism","title":"中国特色社会主义","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/socialism-theory/chinese-socialism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"21st-century-socialism","title":"21世纪社会主义","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/socialism-theory/21st-century-socialism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"mixed-economy","title":"混合经济模式","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/mixed-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nordic-model","title":"北欧模式","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/mixed-economy/nordic-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-market-economy","title":"社会市场经济","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/mixed-economy/social-market-economy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"developmental-state","title":"发展型国家","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/mixed-economy/developmental-state"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cooperative-economy","title":"合作经济","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/mixed-economy/cooperative-economy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"inequality-redistribution","title":"不平等与再分配","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/inequality-redistribution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"income-inequality","title":"收入不平等","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/inequality-redistribution/income-inequality"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wealth-concentration","title":"财富集中","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/inequality-redistribution/wealth-concentration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"redistribution-policies","title":"再分配政策","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/inequality-redistribution/redistribution-policies"},{"seq":4,"slug":"piketty-capital","title":"皮凯蒂与《21世纪资本论》","url":"/h/political-economy/capitalism-socialism-comparison/inequality-redistribution/piketty-capital"}]}]}